  "scope": "On isolated disposable kind v1.36.1 Linux nodes, verify component help and effective Pod arguments contain no legacy --port, --address, or --insecure-port options, and no TCP listeners use the historical insecure ports 10252/10251. Compare secure ports 10257/10259 bound to 127.0.0.1 against an intentionally broad 0.0.0.0 bind. Probe the owned node's fixed /healthz endpoint over HTTPS, discard response bodies, and retain only status/connectivity and listener metadata. In the loopback profile only, verify fixture-CA-signed loopback serving identities and compare no-credential and short-lived API-audience ServiceAccount-token requests to /metrics; discard every body. No ports are published.",
